WEBVTT

00:00:28.567 --> 00:00:29.700
Here.

00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:32.867
Thanks, Sis.

00:00:35.633 --> 00:00:38.367
How do you feel? Any better now?

00:00:38.367 --> 00:00:39.667
A little bit, I guess.

00:00:39.667 --> 00:00:43.033
I told ya it wasn't a good idea
to take the boat there.

00:00:43.033 --> 00:00:46.800
Why do you like traveling by ways
you know will make you sick?

00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:49.033
It's still plenty of fun.

00:00:49.033 --> 00:00:51.000
Okay. If you say so.

00:00:52.667 --> 00:00:54.900
I hope it's a nice place.

00:00:54.900 --> 00:00:56.433
Our new school, I mean.

00:00:56.433 --> 00:00:57.567
Yeah.

00:01:03.767 --> 00:01:05.333
The air sure is fresh.

00:01:05.333 --> 00:01:08.033
I'm sure this is good
for your health, Takumi.

00:01:08.033 --> 00:01:09.767
--Wow!
--Amazing!

00:01:11.500 --> 00:01:13.567
This is totally amazing!

00:01:13.567 --> 00:01:15.833
I'm so glad we came by boat.

00:01:15.833 --> 00:01:19.467
Come on. We didn't
come for the sightseeing.

00:01:30.800 --> 00:01:32.900
You seeing things again?

00:01:32.900 --> 00:01:34.367
Yeah.

00:01:34.367 --> 00:01:38.433
I was thinking how beautiful that
small red speck near the moon is.

00:01:39.833 --> 00:01:42.100
My eyesight's good, but...

00:01:42.100 --> 00:01:45.500
Well, there's an explanation for that.

00:01:45.500 --> 00:01:47.800
Some things can only
be seen by honest people.

00:01:47.800 --> 00:01:50.400
Sure. You're hilarious, Sis.

00:01:56.900 --> 00:01:58.967
Sis...

00:01:58.967 --> 00:02:01.067
Do you see that in the water?

00:02:01.067 --> 00:02:02.067
What?

00:02:02.067 --> 00:02:03.467
Look. Over there.

00:02:32.700 --> 00:02:37.967
"My-HiME"

00:02:39.433 --> 00:02:42.600
<i>All across the blue sky</i>

00:02:42.600 --> 00:02:46.033
<i>our feelings</i>

00:02:46.033 --> 00:02:49.767
<i>are being mounted like gems</i>

00:02:50.967 --> 00:02:54.333
<i>If only you were</i>

00:02:54.333 --> 00:02:57.600
<i>my soul mate</i>

00:02:57.600 --> 00:03:04.000
<i>but reality doesn't work that way</i>

00:03:04.000 --> 00:03:09.433
<i>In the sparkling wind</i>

00:03:09.433 --> 00:03:16.733
<i>the wings of dreams descend</i>

00:03:16.733 --> 00:03:20.467
<i>Gather the courage to go into the future</i>

00:03:20.467 --> 00:03:25.333
<i>with beauty</i>

00:03:27.033 --> 00:03:32.700
<i>The hot heartbeats begin to pulse</i>

00:03:32.700 --> 00:03:35.900
<i>at the same speed</i>

00:03:35.900 --> 00:03:39.800
<i>I felt that day</i>

00:03:39.800 --> 00:03:45.900
<i>I like direct gazes</i>

00:03:45.900 --> 00:03:53.633
<i>I want to stare forever</i>

00:03:55.933 --> 00:03:58.533
Hurry! She's swallowed a lot of water!

00:03:58.533 --> 00:04:00.033
"A Girl's Most Important Event ☆"
Hey, what's she got?

00:04:00.033 --> 00:04:00.967
"A Girl's Most Important Event ☆"
How should I know?

00:04:00.967 --> 00:04:02.367
"A Girl's Most Important Event ☆"
She was holding it when I dragged her out.

00:04:02.367 --> 00:04:03.700
"A Girl's Most Important Event ☆"
She won't let go of it.

00:04:03.700 --> 00:04:04.900
"A Girl's Most Important Event ☆"
Give us a hand!

00:04:04.900 --> 00:04:06.700
Uh, right...

00:04:06.700 --> 00:04:08.800
Hey, can you give us a hand?

00:04:08.800 --> 00:04:11.867
--S-Sure.
--Why is she clutching onto that?

00:04:14.033 --> 00:04:15.533
Hang on...

00:04:15.533 --> 00:04:16.700
Hurry it up.

00:04:16.700 --> 00:04:17.533
There.

00:04:17.533 --> 00:04:19.000
Got it!

00:04:30.033 --> 00:04:32.600
Never mind us! The girl needs CPR!

00:04:32.600 --> 00:04:33.900
She's not breathing!

00:04:33.900 --> 00:04:35.800
What?! All right!

00:04:40.433 --> 00:04:43.100
Um, artificial resuscitation...

00:04:43.100 --> 00:04:45.533
D-Does anybody here know how to do it?

00:04:51.800 --> 00:04:53.400
Why me?

00:04:57.333 --> 00:04:59.333
No!

00:04:59.333 --> 00:05:00.100
What're you doing?!

00:05:00.100 --> 00:05:02.500
You have a perverted
look in your eyes!

00:05:02.500 --> 00:05:03.733
This isn't the time for that!

00:05:03.733 --> 00:05:05.633
No!

00:05:05.633 --> 00:05:08.467
I can't stand it when
you turn into a pervert!

00:05:08.467 --> 00:05:09.933
There's nothing perverted about it!

00:05:09.933 --> 00:05:10.600
Is too!

00:05:10.600 --> 00:05:12.333
--Sis...
--Is not!

00:05:12.333 --> 00:05:13.767
Is too!

00:05:13.767 --> 00:05:15.967
U-Um, I can do it!

00:05:15.967 --> 00:05:17.433
S-Sure...

00:05:17.433 --> 00:05:18.700
That'll be great.

00:05:21.833 --> 00:05:22.700
Hurry!

00:05:22.700 --> 00:05:24.500
I know!

00:06:04.333 --> 00:06:05.333
Sis...

00:06:05.333 --> 00:06:07.767
Wow, that was impressive.

00:06:07.767 --> 00:06:09.533
I couldn't have done it without you.

00:06:09.533 --> 00:06:10.900
It's no big deal.

00:06:10.900 --> 00:06:16.500
Never thought my first aid training
would come in handy like this.

00:06:18.400 --> 00:06:20.700
Ohh...

00:06:20.700 --> 00:06:22.033
I'm all wet.

00:06:23.433 --> 00:06:25.833
You don't want to catch a cold.

00:06:25.833 --> 00:06:27.767
Thanks, Takumi.

00:06:31.367 --> 00:06:33.500
Wha...?! What're you staring at?!

00:06:33.500 --> 00:06:35.033
I wasn't looking!

00:06:35.033 --> 00:06:36.967
You were too!

00:06:36.967 --> 00:06:40.033
What's with you?! You're the worst!

00:06:40.033 --> 00:06:42.033
N-No! I was just...!

00:06:42.033 --> 00:06:43.100
What?

00:06:43.100 --> 00:06:44.900
What do you want?

00:06:44.900 --> 00:06:45.867
You pervert!

00:06:45.867 --> 00:06:47.000
No, you're wrong!

00:06:47.000 --> 00:06:48.400
I don't think so!

00:06:58.700 --> 00:07:02.333
She might've been picked up by a ferry.

00:07:02.333 --> 00:07:03.367
What?

00:07:11.600 --> 00:07:13.433
Miroku...

00:07:43.367 --> 00:07:46.467
Unbelievable...
What's Takumi's problem?

00:07:46.467 --> 00:07:48.967
He didn't take his
afternoon medicine.

00:07:48.967 --> 00:07:50.567
He's gonna get it.

00:08:00.933 --> 00:08:03.067
This can't be the same mark as her.

00:08:15.767 --> 00:08:18.800
There's only one way to see it...

00:08:18.800 --> 00:08:24.433
...that girl was my first kiss.

00:08:24.433 --> 00:08:27.400
Hold on! That doesn't
count as a first kiss!

00:08:27.400 --> 00:08:29.700
I was doing CPR, that's all it was!

00:08:29.700 --> 00:08:34.800
Nobody can say that was
a first kiss, because...

00:08:34.800 --> 00:08:36.867
Huh?

00:08:36.867 --> 00:08:39.067
Oh, darn!

00:08:39.067 --> 00:08:41.967
A change of clothes...
I knew I forgot something.

00:08:49.000 --> 00:08:52.667
Guess this is where I say,
"this leaves me no other choice."

00:08:52.667 --> 00:08:55.533
It's an unfortunate series
of events, that's all.

00:08:58.367 --> 00:08:59.400
Oh yeah?

00:08:59.400 --> 00:09:03.467
So is this a weekend holiday
on the way to your new school?

00:09:03.467 --> 00:09:04.533
Yes.

00:09:04.533 --> 00:09:07.433
Right. And which school?

00:09:07.433 --> 00:09:08.600
It's an independent school...

00:09:08.600 --> 00:09:10.067
Takumi!

00:09:15.533 --> 00:09:17.933
I've been looking for you.

00:09:17.933 --> 00:09:20.633
What's with the uniform, Sis?

00:09:20.633 --> 00:09:23.333
Oh, this?

00:09:23.333 --> 00:09:26.033
It looks like I put all my
regular clothes in the checked luggage.

00:09:26.033 --> 00:09:28.767
If that's your school uniform,
you must be transferring to our school.

00:09:28.767 --> 00:09:30.400
You mean...

00:09:30.400 --> 00:09:33.533
Yeah. We're students of Fuka Academy.

00:09:35.700 --> 00:09:37.867
Right...

00:09:37.867 --> 00:09:39.767
Here you are.

00:09:39.767 --> 00:09:43.400
I'm sorry that my brother made
a total fool of himself before.

00:09:43.400 --> 00:09:45.400
You've got it all wrong.

00:09:45.400 --> 00:09:47.800
Oh, my name's Takumi Tokiha.

00:09:47.800 --> 00:09:50.367
I'll be going into
first year of middle school.

00:09:50.367 --> 00:09:52.667
I apologize for my sister's
behavior earlier, too.

00:09:52.667 --> 00:09:53.933
What's that supposed to mean?

00:09:53.933 --> 00:09:55.800
I'm Yuichi Tate.

00:09:55.800 --> 00:09:56.933
First year, high school.

00:09:56.933 --> 00:10:01.333
And I'm Shiho Munakata!
Second year, middle school!

00:10:01.333 --> 00:10:02.400
H-Hey!

00:10:02.400 --> 00:10:05.467
Y-Your parents aren't the same?

00:10:05.467 --> 00:10:08.000
Oh, no. That's not it at all.

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:10.600
Shiho and I have been friends
since we were little kids.

00:10:10.600 --> 00:10:12.833
What?! Then you're not brother and sister?!

00:10:12.833 --> 00:10:13.833
No!

00:10:13.833 --> 00:10:16.067
But he's like my brother!

00:10:16.067 --> 00:10:18.700
And you're traveling
on the ferry by yourselves?

00:10:18.700 --> 00:10:20.767
Correct!

00:10:20.767 --> 00:10:22.700
Will you stop it?

00:10:25.667 --> 00:10:29.867
Wow! It's true when they say that
rural people are more progressive!

00:10:29.867 --> 00:10:31.667
You're being rude, Sis.

00:10:31.667 --> 00:10:33.367
Enough!

00:10:33.367 --> 00:10:35.433
She followed me! That's all!

00:10:35.433 --> 00:10:37.400
And she's a real pain in the butt!

00:10:37.400 --> 00:10:39.933
A pain?

00:10:39.933 --> 00:10:42.767
Now look what happened!
He made the poor girl cry!

00:10:42.767 --> 00:10:44.533
I think you're being totally rude.

00:10:44.533 --> 00:10:44.967
So!

00:10:44.967 --> 00:10:46.800
What's your story?

00:10:46.800 --> 00:10:49.867
Oh, my name is Mai. Mai Tokiha.

00:10:49.867 --> 00:10:52.100
I'm Takumi's genuine older sister.

00:10:52.100 --> 00:10:54.733
I'll be in first year of high school.

00:10:54.733 --> 00:10:56.933
Pleased to meet your acquaintance!

00:10:56.933 --> 00:10:59.667
Oh. We're in the same grade?!

00:10:59.667 --> 00:11:02.000
That's my line!

00:11:02.000 --> 00:11:03.700
Oh, there you are.

00:11:03.700 --> 00:11:04.800
You guys!

00:11:15.000 --> 00:11:17.467
I can see it. Up ahead.

00:11:17.467 --> 00:11:19.833
You know,

00:11:19.833 --> 00:11:22.767
if the captain wanted to
thank us for the rescue,

00:11:22.767 --> 00:11:25.567
you'd think he'd come
and see us personally.

00:11:25.567 --> 00:11:27.400
Just look outside.

00:11:27.400 --> 00:11:30.733
There's no way he's going
to leave the bridge in this fog.

00:11:30.733 --> 00:11:31.900
What?

00:11:31.900 --> 00:11:33.633
You think I'm stupid?

00:11:35.067 --> 00:11:39.000
Look. You've been whining
and complaining since we met.

00:11:39.000 --> 00:11:41.000
I'm getting fed up with it.

00:11:41.000 --> 00:11:45.100
"The fare's too high."
"What do the waitresses get paid?"

00:11:45.100 --> 00:11:48.633
I don't know,
and frankly, I don't really care.

00:11:48.633 --> 00:11:51.833
I was trying to give you
a chance to make it up to me

00:11:51.833 --> 00:11:53.967
after your sexual harassment stunt.

00:11:53.967 --> 00:11:56.367
You just don't understand, do you?!

00:11:56.367 --> 00:11:58.033
Sexual harassment?!

00:11:58.033 --> 00:12:00.633
You're blowing this
totally out of proportion!

00:12:00.633 --> 00:12:02.767
You're delusional!

00:12:02.767 --> 00:12:06.000
Oh, yeah? You're one
to talk about delusions!

00:12:06.000 --> 00:12:07.567
As in your girlfriend!

00:12:07.567 --> 00:12:10.933
"Brother"! Isn't that what she calls you?

00:12:10.933 --> 00:12:13.533
You must think you're a real player.

00:12:13.533 --> 00:12:15.767
I said, you've got it all wrong!

00:12:15.767 --> 00:12:18.333
I'm only describing what I saw.

00:12:22.367 --> 00:12:23.900
Cruiser from the stern!

00:12:23.900 --> 00:12:24.833
Captain!

00:12:24.833 --> 00:12:27.567
Hard over! This is an emergency!

00:12:43.600 --> 00:12:46.400
What was that all about?

00:12:51.533 --> 00:12:53.733
--No!
--Wait! Hang on a sec!

00:12:55.000 --> 00:12:57.000
Stupid! Pervert! Sicko!

00:12:57.000 --> 00:13:00.867
C-Come on! That was an accident!

00:13:21.833 --> 00:13:23.967
You picked up the girl with the sword!

00:13:23.967 --> 00:13:25.100
Where is she?

00:13:25.100 --> 00:13:26.567
What?!

00:13:31.900 --> 00:13:34.533
What was that about?!

00:13:34.533 --> 00:13:35.933
Did you get in touch
with the coast guard?!

00:13:35.933 --> 00:13:36.967
I can't get through!

00:13:36.967 --> 00:13:38.467
It seems our transmissions are jammed!

00:13:38.467 --> 00:13:39.733
It must be that boat!

00:13:41.933 --> 00:13:45.100
Attention, all passengers.
This is an important announcement.

00:13:45.100 --> 00:13:47.967
We're experiencing strong tidal currents...

00:13:49.933 --> 00:13:51.467
"Infirmary"

00:13:55.733 --> 00:13:57.467
What are you going to do?

00:13:57.467 --> 00:13:58.633
No!

00:14:12.667 --> 00:14:13.867
What?

00:14:23.367 --> 00:14:25.100
Ow, ow, ow...

00:14:25.100 --> 00:14:28.000
I can't believe it.
She really punched me hard!

00:14:28.000 --> 00:14:29.667
What was that noise?!

00:14:29.667 --> 00:14:30.600
It came from mid-ship!

00:14:30.600 --> 00:14:32.000
The infirmary!

00:14:36.933 --> 00:14:38.467
Where'd Mai go?!

00:14:44.333 --> 00:14:48.033
Don't think about it! You've caused
me enough trouble already!

00:14:56.567 --> 00:14:59.367
Those guys are just using
you for their own objectives!

00:14:59.367 --> 00:15:00.800
Why don't you understand that?!

00:15:02.533 --> 00:15:06.700
I can't let any more of them
congregate on Fuka territory!

00:15:06.700 --> 00:15:07.900
The HiME!

00:15:10.333 --> 00:15:11.500
Don't!

00:15:26.033 --> 00:15:28.867
HiME...?

00:15:28.867 --> 00:15:30.800
So I'm wasting my breath?

00:15:32.333 --> 00:15:33.767
Sorry to hear that.

00:15:33.767 --> 00:15:35.400
I'll have to get serious!

00:15:40.467 --> 00:15:41.733
Duran!

00:15:50.400 --> 00:15:51.667
Go!

00:16:15.400 --> 00:16:16.767
--Fire!
--Stay back!

00:16:31.767 --> 00:16:33.533
What's going on?

00:16:37.533 --> 00:16:39.867
Attention passengers.

00:16:39.867 --> 00:16:43.833
It appears that a fire has
broken out on the vehicle deck.

00:16:43.833 --> 00:16:45.633
Move it, kid!

00:16:45.633 --> 00:16:46.967
Uh, yeah.

00:16:49.500 --> 00:16:51.467
It's her!

00:16:51.467 --> 00:16:52.733
Hey!

00:16:53.933 --> 00:16:56.067
The crew will assist you!

00:16:56.067 --> 00:17:00.000
Please remain calm and
evacuate as quickly as possible!

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:01.367
Hurry up, you two!

00:17:01.367 --> 00:17:02.667
But my sister!

00:17:02.667 --> 00:17:04.067
I can't find my brother!

00:17:04.067 --> 00:17:06.067
They're probably on another lifeboat!

00:17:06.067 --> 00:17:06.667
Now hurry!

00:17:06.667 --> 00:17:07.867
--But...
--My brother...!

00:17:07.867 --> 00:17:09.067
Don't worry!

00:17:09.067 --> 00:17:10.333
No!

00:17:11.667 --> 00:17:13.333
There you go!

00:17:15.967 --> 00:17:17.533
Thanks.

00:17:17.533 --> 00:17:18.800
It's okay.

00:17:27.367 --> 00:17:28.800
--What was that?!
--Hang on...

00:17:28.800 --> 00:17:30.033
What was it?!

00:17:30.033 --> 00:17:32.767
Tell me! Tell me! Tell me!

00:17:32.767 --> 00:17:35.567
--What's going on?!
--What're you talking about?

00:17:35.567 --> 00:17:38.067
Your punch really hurt.

00:17:38.067 --> 00:17:41.633
Well, let's just say we're even.

00:17:41.633 --> 00:17:43.500
Sound like a good idea?

00:17:43.500 --> 00:17:44.767
What're you talking about?

00:17:44.767 --> 00:17:46.500
The sexual harassment.

00:17:46.500 --> 00:17:47.900
Will you drop it?!

00:17:47.900 --> 00:17:50.367
I'm going to, that's what I'm saying.

00:17:52.533 --> 00:17:53.800
Takumi...

00:17:53.800 --> 00:17:57.633
It looks like everyone
abandoned ship in a big hurry.

00:17:57.633 --> 00:18:01.033
I'm dreading what'll
happen next on this trip.

00:18:01.033 --> 00:18:04.933
Hey, what kind of place
is Fuka Academy, anyway?

00:18:04.933 --> 00:18:07.400
It's not some creepy school, is it?

00:18:07.400 --> 00:18:09.600
How could it be?

00:18:09.600 --> 00:18:11.667
It's just your average school.

00:18:11.667 --> 00:18:14.800
Okay, tomorrow's going
to be a normal school day.

00:18:14.800 --> 00:18:16.533
Come on. Let's go!

00:18:16.533 --> 00:18:18.067
Don't be saying you forgot something!

00:18:23.767 --> 00:18:25.967
Oh, no!

00:18:25.967 --> 00:18:27.400
Hey, don't do this to me...

00:18:27.400 --> 00:18:28.400
Uh, hey!

00:18:38.400 --> 00:18:41.833
That was your last chance, HiME.
You're finished here.

00:18:41.833 --> 00:18:43.100
It's gone!

00:18:43.100 --> 00:18:45.433
It's gone! I can't find it!

00:18:45.433 --> 00:18:46.567
Why?!

00:18:46.567 --> 00:18:47.700
How would I know?

00:18:47.700 --> 00:18:48.967
Aww...!

00:18:48.967 --> 00:18:50.533
What're you looking for?

00:18:50.533 --> 00:18:51.867
A little container!

00:18:51.867 --> 00:18:53.433
There's medicine in it!

00:19:04.567 --> 00:19:06.700
Duran!

00:19:06.700 --> 00:19:08.700
Load Silver Cartridge!

00:19:10.700 --> 00:19:11.800
Fire!

00:19:16.433 --> 00:19:18.433
Is this it?

00:19:24.067 --> 00:19:25.733
That's it!

00:19:33.967 --> 00:19:35.867
Ouch!

00:19:43.100 --> 00:19:44.867
Oh my god!

00:19:46.900 --> 00:19:47.967
Hey!

00:19:47.967 --> 00:19:51.867
Give that to Takumi!
I'm counting on you!

00:19:51.867 --> 00:19:54.467
Yeah! If I can stay alive, that is!

00:19:58.000 --> 00:19:59.800
This is ridiculous!

00:19:59.800 --> 00:20:04.467
There's no way I'm going
to die in a place like this!

00:20:09.567 --> 00:20:11.000
Wha...?!

00:20:17.933 --> 00:20:19.400
Duran!

00:20:19.400 --> 00:20:20.833
Those flames...

00:20:25.433 --> 00:20:26.633
What's this light?

00:20:26.633 --> 00:20:28.033
Hey!

00:20:34.767 --> 00:20:37.033
So that's what you are.

00:20:37.033 --> 00:20:40.767
I suppose you can see that star as well.

00:20:46.767 --> 00:20:48.367
That stupid fool!

00:20:48.367 --> 00:20:50.833
It's going exactly the way they want it to!

00:20:50.833 --> 00:20:52.367
Hey! You!

00:20:52.367 --> 00:20:53.367
Here's a warning.

00:20:53.367 --> 00:20:55.000
Don't go to Fuka Academy.

00:20:56.467 --> 00:20:58.467
If you go, you will die.

00:21:03.667 --> 00:21:05.067
Die?

00:21:25.500 --> 00:21:26.767
Then she's still...!

00:21:26.767 --> 00:21:27.400
What?!

00:21:27.400 --> 00:21:28.467
Sis...

00:21:28.467 --> 00:21:29.833
No way...

00:21:29.833 --> 00:21:32.100
Sis!

00:21:36.700 --> 00:21:38.633
I was getting tired of waiting.

00:21:38.633 --> 00:21:40.100
Unbelievable.

00:21:40.100 --> 00:21:42.433
Well, anyway...

00:21:42.433 --> 00:21:46.000
...Mai-HiME plus one, welcome.

00:21:47.033 --> 00:21:49.900
Now! On with the arrangements!

00:22:11.000 --> 00:22:12.767
Where am I?

00:22:16.467 --> 00:22:18.333
No way...

00:22:19.933 --> 00:22:21.467
It's her!

00:22:23.333 --> 00:22:24.900
What?!

00:22:26.333 --> 00:22:31.867
<i>I couldn't tell you not to lose your way</i>

00:22:31.867 --> 00:22:37.600
<i>There are thoughts that'll never reach you</i>

00:22:37.600 --> 00:22:42.800
<i>A smile that is too Ionely quivers</i>

00:22:42.800 --> 00:22:48.000
<i>I puzzle over my wounds LONELY GOOD-BYE</i>

00:22:48.000 --> 00:22:54.733
<i>Even my passion hurts</i>

00:22:54.733 --> 00:22:59.767
<i>as I chase after an eternal fragment</i>

00:22:59.767 --> 00:23:06.533
<i>You were the sky, you were the dream</i>

00:23:06.533 --> 00:23:10.400
<i>The days that burn and melt</i>

00:23:11.967 --> 00:23:18.033
<i>Make them unforgettable memories</i>

00:23:18.033 --> 00:23:23.500
<i>Wear them proudly on your chest</i>

00:23:23.500 --> 00:23:25.367
<i>SEARCH FOR MY LIFE</i>

00:23:25.367 --> 00:23:29.633
<i>We will be able to meet again</i>

00:23:29.633 --> 00:23:34.800
<i>I loved those transparent eyes</i>

00:23:34.800 --> 00:23:39.833
<i>Now we have our own paths</i>

00:23:39.833 --> 00:23:43.033
<i>carrying on RESTARTING</i>

00:23:56.067 --> 00:23:56.800
"After-School Secrets"

00:23:56.800 --> 00:23:57.867
"After-School Secrets"
Hey.

00:23:57.867 --> 00:23:59.367
"After-School Secrets"
I thought this was supposed to be

00:23:59.367 --> 00:24:01.400
"After-School Secrets"
a burning hot story set in a school.

00:24:01.400 --> 00:24:02.500
"After-School Secrets"
It was burning.

00:24:02.500 --> 00:24:03.700
"After-School Secrets"
The ferry and all those cars.

00:24:03.700 --> 00:24:05.533
"After-School Secrets"
No. That's not what I meant.

00:24:05.533 --> 00:24:07.967
"After-School Secrets"
The next episode will take place at school.

00:24:07.967 --> 00:24:09.400
"After-School Secrets"
Will there be passion?

00:24:09.400 --> 00:24:11.371
"After-School Secrets"
Yeah. Burning passion.
